## The four surfaces

Scaffolded by [create-ai-cli](https://github.com/danishvirani/create-ai-cli). Everything is wired and stdlib-only:

- **CLI** — `src/{{package}}/cli.py`, a stdlib `argparse` binary. Add commands by copying the `{{command}}` pattern.
- **Claude Code plugin** — `plugins/{{name}}/`: a manifest, a slash command per CLI command, and an auto-loading bootstrap skill. Use it with `claude --plugin-dir ./plugins/{{name}}` or symlink it into `~/.claude/plugins/`.
- **MCP server** — `src/{{package}}/mcp.py`, a hand-rolled stdio JSON-RPC server with no SDK dependency. Run it with `{{name}} mcp` (or `python -m {{package}}.mcp`).
- **brief command** — `{{name}} brief` prints a Markdown context block to paste at the start of an AI session, so the agent starts with the project's shape already loaded.

